Error [E0112]: `sqrt` needs Float, F32, or Measurement<Float>, not Int (a whole number)
  --> core_math_float_type_mismatch.jet:4:15
    |
  4 |     math.sqrt(1)
    |               ^
 Why: Math functions preserve their numeric knowledge grade
 Fix: Pass a Float or F32 value, or use `sqrt` with a measurement
